    <string name="i18n_g1_notif_all_other_help">Also buzz for apps that aren\'t in the lists above (e.g. BeReal). Android doesn\'t let NOOP see every installed app, so this is how you cover the rest. Can be chatty; quiet hours and \"only when worn\" still apply.</string>
