    <string name="i18n_g1_notif_effort_help">Once a day, a notification when your Effort reaches the low end of today\'s optimal strain range (from your recovery). Posts after your strap syncs and NOOP scores the day.</string>
    <string name="i18n_g1_notif_fine_tune">Fine-tune when alerts reach your wrist.</string>
    <string name="i18n_g1_notif_master_blurb">When on, NOOP taps your wrist for the apps you pick below, so you can leave your phone and still feel what matters.</string>
    <string name="i18n_g1_notif_morning_help">After last night is processed, a notification with your Charge and Rest. Posts once a day, after your strap has synced the night.</string>
